          "page_number": 1,
          "kind": "body",
          "text": "Individual Income Tax Rate Schedules\nTax Year 2026 — Taxable Income Brackets by Filing Status\nThe schedules below set out the marginal rates applicable to ordinary taxable income for the 2026 tax year. Amounts shown are\nthe bracket boundaries after the application of the standard deduction or itemized deductions, as applicable. Each rate applies only\nto the portion of taxable income falling within the stated bracket. Bracket boundaries are subject to annual inflation adjustment.\nTable 1. Ordinary Income Rate Schedules, Tax Year 2026",
